 ('DailyMed-calcium-carbonate','https://www.dailymed.nlm.nih.gov/dailymed/drugInfo.cfm?setid=667ffb59-9bff-45a7-89f0-ccfa0d841909','DailyMed official submitted drug label','Full label, Active ingredient/Purpose; update 4 December 2025','The labelled active ingredient is calcium carbonate; identity alone provides no adverse-event rate for a model reaction.','Der genannte Wirkstoff ist Calciumcarbonat; die Identität liefert keine Nebenwirkungsrate einer Modellreaktion.','Submitted label, not an FDA approval claim or trial. Never use it alone as a source for belching/fullness incidence.'),
 ('Rennie-Deflatine-SmPC','https://www.medicines.org.uk/emc/product/13858/smpc','Manufacturer SmPC via electronic Medicines Compendium','2/4.8/5.1/5.2, complete clinical/pharmacology sections read','Calcium carbonate, magnesium carbonate and simeticone are listed; possible gastrointestinal adverse reactions do not establish a model-specific incidence.','Genannt sind Calciumcarbonat, Magnesiumcarbonat und Simeticon; mögliche Magen-Darm-Nebenwirkungen bestimmen keine Modellhäufigkeit.','The product contains magnesium carbonate, not the magnesium hydroxide calculation portion. Manufacturer spontaneous-report text has no transferable incidence denominator.'),
